  "_readme": [
    "Seed figures for the Design Wallet salary dashboard.",
    "",
    "baselines are NATIONAL medians for annual FIXED CTC in lakhs per annum.",
    "A city figure is baseline * city.index * mode.index * employer.index.",
    "The national median sits between Tier 1 and Tier 2, so Tier 1 cities index",
    "ABOVE 1.0 and Tier 2 cities below it. Bangalore is the top of the range.",
    "",
    "Each baseline is [p25, p50, p75]. A null baseline means the role/level pair",
    "does not meaningfully exist in the Indian market (there is no VP of Video",
    "Editing) and it is not offered in the UI.",
    "",
    "Real community submissions override these once a cell reaches 5 reports.",
    "See .claude/SALARY-PROJECT.md for the methodology and .claude/DECISIONS.md 12."
  ],
  "sources": [
    "Public job listings on LinkedIn, Instahyre, Cutshort and Wellfound, India, 2025-2026",
    "AmbitionBox and Glassdoor India role pages, read as ranges rather than point estimates",
    "Published Indian design-industry and startup compensation reports, 2024-2026",
    "Agency and studio rate cards where published"
  ],

